sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant A as LangChain agent
    participant M as MCP client
    participant S as waha-mcp server
    participant W as WAHA REST API
    participant X as WhatsApp

    U->>A: "Send 'hello' to chat X"
    A->>A: Resolve chat_id from tool output
    A->>M: call waha_send_text
    M->>S: JSON-RPC tools/call (stdio)
    S->>W: POST /api/sendText + X-Api-Key
    W->>X: Deliver message
    X-->>W: Message ACK
    W-->>S: 200 message object
    S-->>M: Compact JSON result
    M-->>A: Tool result
    A-->>U: Confirmation with message id

    alt WAHA unreachable or 4xx/5xx
        W-->>S: Error response
        S-->>M: Tool error (status + body)
        M-->>A: Tool exception
        A-->>U: Report failure, no retry without consent
    end
